Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start the drop-off tech process") -> action(n2,"inform customer about canceling the order") -> action(n3,"has the order already been fulfilled") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n10,"mark script(s) as declined by the customer in IS") -> converge(c3) -> action(n7,"script order is declined") -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"process customer notification") -> action(n9,"process completed") -> end(e1)